    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>The HMWSG is the shotgun of the Spectre Master Gear line, made to Council specification and released only through Spectre requisitions. It does everything a combat shotgun should do slightly better than anything on the open market: tighter pattern, longer reach, six shells and no recoil to speak of. Owning one without Spectre authority invites questions.</p><p><strong>Grades:</strong> This weapon rolls one more damage die at elite grade (a greater striking rune in Pathfinder) and a second at paragon grade (major striking).</p>"
